{"version":1,"content":"<p>憑處境劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》「Bonnie」一角成功入屋的林凱恩（Iris），自2015年奪得港姐「友誼小姐」入行至今已11個年頭。</p><p>她前晚（19日）出席台慶時，竟別出心裁地以一身「畢業生」造型驚喜現身紅地氈，在華麗的白色晚裝外披上黑色畢業</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T02:23:52.980592+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T02:01:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T02:17:14.848545+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T02:17:14.848545+00:00","content_hash":"4f2e7ead6eece4064450da10010acb384553a3fbca49a7a9b94a31637f24e847","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}